{
  "app_id": 2999500,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "STUNT BOOST Blast through cardboard tracks, master your momentum and shave off milliseconds to earn medals and challenge friends on a fingerboard with no speed limit. Race through skate-infused parcours as fast as possible! Replay and perfect your runs to earn medals, unlocking more rooms in your home featuring new levels and abilities. Climb online leaderboards for each level. Beat your friends' scores to challenge them. Perform big leaps, grinds and flips to boost through childhood memories. Control gravity to dive mid-air or dash downhill. Explore and search for shortcuts while finding collectibles along the way. Skate as fast as you can manage – There is no speed limit!"
  },
